  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat the oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut\n• the sweet potato into wedges and place on a lined\n• oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with\n• salt and pepper. Toss to coat, then spread out in a\n• single layer and bake until tender, 25-30 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60b5b8d21f5315364e5e37a9/step-a6352f9a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the wedges are baking, slice the haloumi\n• into 2 thin pieces per person. Thinly slice the\n• brown onion. Thinly slice the tomato.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60b5b8d21f5315364e5e37a9/step-86dbf36c.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a drizzle of olive oil in a medium frying pan\n• over a medium heat. Add the onion and cook,\n• stirring often, until softened, 5-6 minutes. Add\n• the balsamic vinegar(for the onion), water and\n• brown sugar and mix well. Cook until dark and\n• sticky, 3-5 minutes. Transfer to a small bowl. Wash\n• out the pan. Return the pan to a medium-high heat\n• with a drizzle of olive oil. Pat the haloumi dry with\n• paper towel and add to the pan. Cook until golden,\n• 1-2 minutes each side.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60b5b8d21f5315364e5e37a9/step-ae484092.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place the bake-at-home burger buns on a wire\n• rack in the oven until heated through, 3 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60b5b8d21f5315364e5e37a9/step-32ab9a11.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, combine the mixed salad\n• leaves (keep some plain for the burgers!) with the\n• balsamic vinegar (for the salad) and a drizzle of\n• olive oil. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60b5b8d21f5315364e5e37a9/step-b7cf8624.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cut the buns in half and spread the bases with\n• creamy pesto dressing. Top with the reserved\n• mixed salad leaves, the tomato slices, haloumi and\n• caramelised onions. Serve with the sweet potato\n• wedges and salad.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60b5b8d21f5315364e5e37a9/step-83456380.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
